WEBVTT

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:00.496
I decided to focus on just one item.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:02.336
An item I can't live without:

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:04.000
my morning cup of coffee.

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:08.056
Well, it turned out
to be not so simple at all.

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:09.096
(Laughter)

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:10.735
This quest took me months.

00:02:10.759 --> 00:02:13.216
It took me around the world.

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:18.696
Because I discovered
that my coffee would not be possible

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:21.776
without hundreds of people
I take for granted.

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:23.696
So I would thank the trucker

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:26.416
who drove the coffee beans
to the coffee shop.

00:02:26.440 --> 00:02:29.736
But he couldn't have done his job
without the road.

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:32.656
So I would thank the people
who paved the road.